        "TileImage": "$($repository bbb337dc-9ccb-43bb-b305-8c57d946dd20).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rOur client is a person of popularity, enjoying networking and overseeing people. That&apos;s why these five loners with just one or zero friends stand as unpredictable variables in his way.\r\rSo, as a very normal reaction, he hired us to remove the variables with some rather confusing conditions. But the pay is good and ICA approved, so you just need to worry about the shot.\r\rHappy chase, 47.",
